cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use invoice-agent in your work, cite it with these metadata.
title: "invoice-agent: invoice extraction and purchase order matching with explainable decisions"
type: software
authors:
  - name: superintelligenceco contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/superintelligenceco/invoice-agent
url: https://superintelligenceco.github.io/invoice-agent/
abstract: >-
  invoice-agent reads invoice PDFs, matches them against purchase orders and goods receipts with
  2-way and 3-way matching, and returns an auto-approve, needs-review, or reject decision with
  stable reason codes. It ships a labeled synthetic dataset and an eval command.
keywords:
  - accounts payable
  - invoice
  - three-way match
  - purchase order
  - pdf extraction
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
